# ============================================================
# What NOT to save into version history
# ============================================================
#
# Scott: everything the game needs to RUN is committed, including
# lib/phaser.min.js and the generated assets/*-inline.js files.
# There is no build step - you can clone this and double-click
# index.html. That is deliberate.
#
# What is excluded is either huge, re-downloadable, or specific
# to one computer.

# --- Art pack downloads ------------------------------------
# The Kenney zips are 0.4-1.5 MB each and are only ever inputs to
# tools/build-assets.py. What the game actually loads -
# assets/sprites/sprites-inline.js - IS committed, and
# assets/sprites/README.txt records exactly which pack and which
# files came out of it. Re-download from kenney.nl if you need to
# rebuild the art.
state-quest/tools/*.zip

# --- Google Drive ------------------------------------------
# This project lives in a Drive folder, which litters it with
# these. None of them belong in history.
desktop.ini
.tmp.drivedownload/
.tmp.driveupload/
*.gdoc
*.gsheet

# --- Editors and tools -------------------------------------
.claude/settings.local.json
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- Operating system junk ---------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
.DS_Store

# --- Python leftovers from tools/ --------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
